<title>MALAYSIA: Bank Negara's reserves rise to 67.60 bln ringgit.</title>
<headline>Bank Negara's reserves rise to 67.60 bln ringgit.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara's gold, foreign exchange and other reserves rose to 67.60 billion ringgit as at September 14 against 67.46 billion a fortnight earlier, the Bank said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The central bank said its total assets and liabilities fell to 95.17 billion ringgit from 96.13 billion two weeks earlier.</p>
<p>(In bln ringgit) Sept 14 1996    Aug 30 1996	Sept 15 1995</p>
<p>Reserves	    67.60	     67.46		66.50</p>
<p>Assets		95.17	     96.13		92.64</p>
<p>Currency	    19.80	     20.04		17.60</p>
<p>Govt paper	   3.11		3.25		 1.90</p>
